# Every file under the assets directory is uploaded and publicly served, and
# the assets directory here is the repository root. Without this list that
# includes .git — the whole history, downloadable by anyone who guesses the
# path — and .wrangler, which caches the Cloudflare account id.
#
# Do not add .well-known to this file. iOS reads the app association from it.
.git
.gitignore
.wrangler
.assetsignore
node_modules
README.md
